        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0605U, Bordeau Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very sleek Bordeau Lever made by Weslock features a beveled edged round rose with a elegant slightly curved lever handle. This grants the Traditional Weslock Bordeau Door Lever an air of romance that will add subtle victorian detail. Available in 8 different finish colors. It is adjustable to fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The backset is also adjustable for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with a removable faceplate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classically design lever is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction as well as lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Weslock Bordeau Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function meets ANSI A 156.2 Grade 2 cylindrical lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>Rose and lever material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latches include removable faceplates.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin lock cylinder for entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Removable door lever prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li>Panic-proof keyed entry and privacy functions - one turn of interior lever unlocks and opens door.</li>\r\n<li>Push-button locking rosette.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li>Fully <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Weslock Bordeau Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Style: Wave</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Style: Round</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate </li>\r\n<li>Fits doors prepared with 2-1/8\" cross hole and 1\" edge hole</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock. Door lever operates latch from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking for privacy. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy lock; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. Locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and push button on interior rose. Turning inside lever will release lock and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>This Item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/tasteful-traditional-door-levers\">Traditional Door Levers</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
