                "description": "Traditional Weslock Bordeau Door Lever - This very sleek Bordeau Lever made by Weslock features a beveled edged round rose with a elegant slightly curved lever handle. This grants the Traditional Weslock Bordeau Door Lever an air of romance that will add subtle victorian detail. Available in 8 different finish colors. It is adjustable to fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The backset is also adjustable for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with a removable faceplate.",
